Package: gmdhpmm
Title: GMDH with EstemPMM-Based Cumulant-Adaptive Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Serhii", "Zabolotnii",
           email = "zabolotniua@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0242-2234")))
Description: Implements cumulant-adaptive Group Method of Data Handling
    ('GMDH') models whose inner coefficient-estimation step dispatches between
    least squares and Polynomial Maximization Method estimators ('PMM2' and
    'PMM3') from the 'EstemPMM' package. The package adds bootstrap-stabilized
    residual cumulant diagnostics for small GMDH partitions, per-partial-model
    estimator dispatch inside the self-organized tournament, reserve-aware
    external criteria, robust baseline estimators, and experimental weak-moment
    extensions.
